* Lite sub mute, power loss: worst part at 70 C with round 2's premise (VMID collapses at +5V 3.4 V)
* 70 C, VTO 2.5 V, KP 0.04 (Rds at Vgs 4.5 V ~ 12.5 ohm per FET).
* +5V falls 5.18 V -> 0 in 20 ms from t = 2 s; LOUT2/ROUT2 (VMID 1.65 V) collapse in 2 ms once
* +5V < 3.4 V. C90 charges from +5V through Q11 from t = 0.
.param VTO=2.5 KP=0.04 TOLHI=1.0 BFQ=416.4
.include models.inc
.include circuit.inc
.include lpf.inc
.options TEMP=70 TNOM=25
.param TF5={20m} TC={2+20m*(1-3.4/5.18)}
V5 p5 0 PWL(0 0 0.01 5.18 2 5.18 {2+TF5} 0)
Vl lout 0 PWL(0 0 1.0 1.65 {TC} 1.65 {TC+2m} 0)
Vr rout 0 PWL(0 0 1.0 1.65 {TC} 1.65 {TC+2m} 0)
.tran 20u 3 0 20u
.measure tran sub_min MIN v(subl) FROM=1.99 TO=3
.measure tran lp_min MIN v(l2) FROM=1.99 TO=3
.measure tran band_pk MAX v(h2) FROM=1.99 TO=3
.measure tran band_min MIN v(h2) FROM=1.99 TO=3
.measure tran mute_at_collapse FIND v(mute) AT={TC}
.measure tran mute_late FIND v(mute) AT=2.9
.end
